  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop parsley.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.\n• Drain sweetcorn.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68198ff26326cd47f1a59ab6/step-ff13d600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large ovenproof saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook soffritto mix and sweetcorn, stirring, until softened, 6-7 minutes.\n• Add half the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are ‘popping’ out",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68198ff26326cd47f1a59ab6/step-08145c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! This is a mild spice blend, but use less if you’re sensitive to heat! To the pan, add cannellini beans and All-American spice blend.\n• Cook, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, the salt, BBQ sauce and water. Cook, stirring, until well combined, 2-3 minutes. Season with pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68198ff26326cd47f1a59ab6/step-9625d820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Sprinkle bean mixture evenly with Cheddar cheese and cover with a lid (or foil).\n• Bake until thickened and cheese is melted, 10-12 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68198ff26326cd47f1a59ab6/step-4f7c4f30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice bake-at-home ciabatta in half lengthways, then slice each half diagonally across.\n• Place the butter and remaining garlic in a small microwave-safe bowl. Microwave in 10 second bursts, until melted. Stir through half the parsley. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Brush garlic butter over the cut-side of ciabatta slices.\n• Place ciabatta slices directly on a wire rack in the oven. Bake until golden, 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68198ff26326cd47f1a59ab6/step-9ba47240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide BBQ baked beans between bowls.\n• Garnish with remaining parsley.\n• Serve with garlic bread. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68198ff26326cd47f1a59ab6/step-8ce1cf50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
